<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="section-label">About</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Built for industry.<br>Ready from day one.</h2>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>
        I'm a mechanical engineer with an M.Sc. in Mechatronics & Automation from ZHAW, 
        based in Winterthur. My background covers the full product development cycle — 
        from early-stage CAD concepts through tolerance analysis, simulation, physical 
        testing, and handover to series production.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've worked across medical devices, IoT hardware, and industrial systems — 
        always in environments where precision matters and mistakes have real consequences. 
        I'm comfortable on the design side and equally at home working closely with 
        production teams, suppliers, and technicians on the shop floor.
      </p>
      <p>
        What drives me is seeing a component go from a sketch to something that works 
        reliably in the field — and being part of the decisions that make that happen. 
        I'm looking for an industrial engineering role in Switzerland where I can 
        contribute immediately and grow technically.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-details">
